# .llm — current structure + plan

> **For LLM agents:** this file is the authoritative snapshot of the
> repo's actual state. If you need to know "what exists right now",
> read this first. `README.md` is the user-facing intro; `PROJECT.md`
> is the contributor's manual; `.llm` is the live truth.

Last regenerated: 2026-09-08

---

## What this project is

**llmscheme** — a tool that keeps a "living logic scheme" of a
project's modules and data flow in a single JSON file, readable by
humans, AI agents, and a visual editor. Three entry points over one
shared core.

---

